{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/ogAufBgPpBk\n是非に及ばず"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/KZNDIhxGwoQ\nフォルテシモ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/xpruiYFMF_g\n命の色"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "42枚目シングル「是非に及ばず」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "発売中⚡️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202608/mobbRDvek.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私ひよこじゃないもん、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でも似てるのは否めない　仕方ない🐥"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぴよこのロックもたまらん可愛いです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "絶賛全国ツアー中です。\n空港で本読んで、新幹線で音楽聴いて、バスからその地を眺める。今年も味わってます。みんなで頑張ってます。\n8月も会えるのを楽しみにしています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202608/mobrvQ268.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今にも溶けてしまいそうだ、よまにゃ、気をつけるんだよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みなさま、読書は進んでいますか？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本屋さんへ行くと、\n「夏休みの課題図書！」\n「夏に読むべき一冊！」\nいろんな見出しにわくわくします。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏はぜひ、読書を楽しもうね📖🌻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202608/mobsjJZdy.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/JKnlyoelXEI"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "真夏の全国ツアーと連動して、メンバーが地方にお邪魔しています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は、宮城県松島へ。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とんでもなく素敵な場所へ、終始大興奮で行ってきました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202608/mobDsDAvG.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちまちま"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四葉のクローバーを探す私。こういうの大好き。\n見つからなかったけど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "久しく1人で散歩していなかったので、初心に戻りました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "さくさんぽも記念すべき第10弾です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽しみにしてくれて、見てくれてありがとう〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みなさんのおかげですね\n改めて本当にありがとう^_^"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また、ここぞという時に〝おさんぽおとも〟も呼びたいよね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "特別な時にね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202608/mobA7mivq.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "第10弾記念　初回さくさんぽ　子供すぎる顔"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日から8月のようです。\n暑い中、毎日お疲れ様です。\nいつもより水分はこまめに摂りましょうね◎\n自分の体調管理は自分でしよう◎\n元気でいてね　私も元気でいます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "遠藤さくら"}], "source": "official"}